#: ../../source/docs/smartrtl-mode.rst:5 5e9e7b37aaa443dbb751f3b0ac547fd1
msgid "Smart RTL Mode"
msgstr "SmartRTL 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/smartrtl-mode.rst:10 ee7ee6adcf6048509cb3043109c07e72
msgid ""
"When switched into Smart RTL, like regular RTL, the vehicle will attempt to "
"return home.  The \"Smart\" part of this mode is that it will retrace a safe"
" path home instead of returning directly home.  This can be useful if there "
"are obstacles between the vehicle and the home position. Once at the "
"destination it will hold position if a surface vehicle, or loiter/circle "
"around the destination if it is a boat."
msgstr ""
"切换到 SmartRTL 后，与常规 RTL 类似，车辆将尝试返回 Home 点。该模式「智能」之处在于它会沿原路安全返回，而非直接飞回 Home "
"点。当车辆与 Home 点之间存在障碍物时，此功能非常有用。到达目的地后，地面车辆将就地保持位置，而船只将在目的地附近悬停/绕圈。"

#: ../../source/docs/smartrtl-mode.rst:14 233deb4210bf41d387d901b1c5849ec9
msgid ""
"The vehicle must have a good position estimate (LEDs should be green) when "
"the rover is armed or SmartRTL will be disabled.  If the vehicle is armed "
"without a good position estimate, \"SmartRTL deactivated: bad position\" "
"will be sent to the ground station."
msgstr ""
"Rover 解锁时必须具有良好的定位估计（LED 应为绿色），否则 SmartRTL "
"将被禁用。如果在没有良好定位估计的情况下解锁，地面站将收到「SmartRTL deactivated: bad position」消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/smartrtl-mode.rst:16 a9b6112b25084ce3886a25c407216fae
msgid ""
"The path used to return home is captured in a buffer as the vehicle flies "
"around in any other mode.  The path is \"simplified\" (meaning curved paths "
"are turned into a series of straight lines) and \"pruned\" (meaning loops "
"are removed).  The buffer is of a limited size (see below). When it gets "
"close to being full, \"SmartRTL low on space\" will be sent to the ground "
"station as an information message and once it is full, \"SmartRTL "
"deactivated: buffer full\" will appear on the ground stations's HUD and the "
"user will no longer be able to switch into this mode. To avoid SmartRTL "
"being deactivated, you can switch into the mode temporarily, bleeding off "
"path points for a while when returning, then exit the mode and continue "
"until the space becomes low again."
msgstr ""
"用于返回 Home "
"的路径是在车辆以任何其他模式飞行时在缓冲区中捕获的。路径将被「简化」（即曲线路径转换为一系列直线段）和「剪枝」（即去除环路）。缓冲区大小有限（见下文）。当缓冲区接近满时，地面站将收到「SmartRTL"
" low on space」的信息消息；一旦满载，地面站 HUD 上将显示「SmartRTL deactivated: buffer "
"full」，用户将无法再切换至此模式。为避免 SmartRTL "
"被停用，可临时切换到该模式以消耗部分路径点，然后退出模式继续飞行，直到空间再次不足时重复操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/smartrtl-mode.rst:18 6d911f11cb79412eac87fc1f529dcb1b
msgid ""
":ref:`RTL_SPEED <RTL_SPEED>` can be used to set the speed (in meters/second)"
" at which the vehicle will return to home.  By default this parameter is "
"zero, meaning the :ref:`WP_SPEED <WP_SPEED>` parameter values will be used, "
"or :ref:`CRUISE_SPEED <CRUISE_SPEED>` in versions preceding Rover 4.0, if "
":ref:`WP_SPEED <WP_SPEED>` is also 0."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RTL_SPEED <RTL_SPEED>` 可用于设置车辆返回 Home 时的速度（单位：米/秒）。该参数默认为零，表示将使用 "
":ref:`WP_SPEED <WP_SPEED>` 参数值；若 :ref:`WP_SPEED <WP_SPEED>` 也为 0，在 Rover 4.0"
" 之前的版本中则使用 :ref:`CRUISE_SPEED <CRUISE_SPEED>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/smartrtl-mode.rst:19 973b3fc911a74d8ea3e05c5a684a64e6
msgid ""
":ref:`SRTL_ACCURACY <SRTL_ACCURACY>` controls the accuracy (in meters) of "
"the simplification and pruning performed.  The simplify algorithm will turn "
"curved paths into straight lines but the line should never be more than this"
" distance from the original path.  The pruning algorithm will cut paths that"
" come within this many meters of each other."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SRTL_ACCURACY <SRTL_ACCURACY>` "
"控制简化和剪枝操作的精度（单位：米）。简化算法将曲线路径转换为直线段，但直线与原路径的偏差不超过此距离。剪枝算法将截断彼此距离小于此值（米）的路径段。"

#: ../../source/docs/smartrtl-mode.rst:20 df335829fec34b78980104ce0b3a264d
msgid ""
":ref:`SRTL_POINTS <SRTL_POINTS>` controls the maximum number of points that "
"can be stored.  Each additional 100 points requires about 3k of RAM. The "
"maximum number of points allowed is 500."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SRTL_POINTS <SRTL_POINTS>` "
"控制可存储的最大路径点数量。每增加100个路径点约需3KB内存。允许的最大路径点数为500个。"
